  "summary_md": "**Hooman AI Lab ([@HoomanBio](https://x.com/HoomanBio/status/2116524572006842450))** releases **Qwen3.8-27B-LabOpen-v1**, an Apache-2.0 research refinement of Qwen3.8-27B that keeps coding and function calling while improving verifiable scientific computation across six domains; the thread reports agentic coding rising from 32% to 72% on 78 deterministic tests, and ships merged FP8 weights plus the LoRA adapter ([HoomanBio2021/Qwen3.8-27B-LabOpen-v1](https://huggingface.co/HoomanBio2021/Qwen3.8-27B-LabOpen-v1)).",
